{"id":"21202","t":{"th":"ขอให้โชคดีมีชัยในโลกแฟนตาซี","ro":"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo!","en":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world!","na":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21202-mPOr80AEjUcZ.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21202-mPOr80AEjUcZ.png","color":"#5daee4","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21202-UWijdV7RMnXo.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":10,"dur":23,"season":"WINTER","year":2016,"start":"2016-01-14","country":"JP","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"score":79,"pop":527585,"studio":"Studio DEEN","desc":"Kazuma Satou decides that today is the day to get out of the house for a bit. Since he dies, pointlessly, it's clearly a bad choice. The goddess who greets him in the afterlife, however, offers him a chance to be reborn in a world not unlike that of a video game, and as a bonus she'll even throw in a cool item or power! Can't possibly be a bad choice, right? Except he arrives with no money at all, dead average skills, and his \"bonus\" isn't useful at all--since he picked the goddess, Aqua, herself. How are the two of them supposed to defeat the evil Devil King and live happily ever after? Well, for them, it probably starts with day laboring rather than adventuring. And it's only going to get more disappointing from there!","descTh":"คาซึมะ ซาโต้ตัดสินใจว่าวันนี้เป็นวันที่ต้องออกจากบ้านสักหน่อย นับตั้งแต่เขาตายไปอย่างไม่มีจุดหมาย เห็นได้ชัดว่าเป็นทางเลือกที่ไม่ดี อย่างไรก็ตาม เทพธิดาที่ทักทายเขาในชีวิตหลังความตายได้เสนอโอกาสให้เขาได้เกิดใหม่ในโลกที่ไม่ต่างจากวิดีโอเกม และเธอจะมอบไอเทมหรือพลังเจ๋งๆ ให้กับเธออีกด้วย! คงเป็นทางเลือกที่ไม่ดีใช่ไหม? ยกเว้นว่าเขามาโดยไม่มีเงินเลย ทักษะธรรมดาๆ ตายๆ และ \"โบนัส\" ของเขาก็ไม่มีประโยชน์เลย เพราะเขาเลือกเทพีอควาเอง พวกเขาทั้งสองควรจะเอาชนะราชาปีศาจผู้ชั่วร้ายและใช้ชีวิตอย่างมีความสุขตลอดไปได้อย่างไร? สำหรับพวกเขา มันอาจเริ่มต้นด้วยการทำงานในแต่ละวันมากกว่าการผจญภัย และจะยิ่งน่าผิดหวังมากขึ้นเท่านั้น!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"NU87y-38glA","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/21202","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/30831","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"anione_dub","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxKIvf772DYSEy8njbd-JS_-wijC-hnqi","lang":"dub","eps":[["7","y:MmBE3HkrmNE",1764937068,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[19.1,109.2],[1318.7,1410.1]]}],["8","y:VYg7BaoVTkw",1764937068,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[61.4,150.1],[1316.8,1408.5]]}],["9","y:crpEQyYRPK8",1764937068,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[166.8,240.1],[1318.6,1410.1]]}],["10","y:yX-lJqYfC9c",1764937068,"~",null,null,{"d":1421,"sk":[[1316.8,1410.1]],"fin":1}],["5","y:IgpCBVWyyW4",1763131062,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[133.0,223.1],[1320.4,1408.4]]}],["1","y:yzX2pYTizKU",1763121736,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[1320.4,1409.0]]}],["6","y:z-IXOvlH71E",1763121733,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[113.5,202.2],[1320.5,1410.1]]}],["4","y:u2DJXXBVT_E",1763121724,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[112.5,201.2],[1320.5,1408.5]]}],["2","y:7juJrOHJSh4",1763121630,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[117.5,206.0],[1319.4,1410.1]]}],["3","y:B9wmdMBVWzs",1763121622,"x",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[135.9,209.2],[1319.5,1408.6]]}]]},{"p":"anione_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_YV8EWtbQXEio5-LDvynckvlDZPpAf0x","lang":"dub","eps":[["7","y:qrCcyCw3rXs",1698743190,"~",null,null,{"d":1430,"sk":[[20.6,109.2],[1320.5,1420.1]]}],["8","y:eV2Kj_HMtDU",1698743190,"~",null,null,{"d":1430,"sk":[[57.7,150.1],[1320.5,1420.1]]}],["9","y:bKpzMY6dfXs",1698743190,"~",null,null,{"d":1431}],["10","y:DK50SZz1e6M",1698743190,"~",null,null,{"d":1431,"sk":[[1320.6,1420.1]],"fin":1}],["6","y:QArkbJxU5J8",1689595207,"x",null,null,{"d":1430,"sk":[[113.5,202.2],[1320.5,1420.1]]}],["5","y:jzOTdcSrGJ8",1689336008,"x",null,null,{"d":1430,"sk":[[149.5,223.2],[1320.5,1420.1]]}],["4","y:1hz_6aAk5RA",16892